notes               = "Untitled in source. Three lines, and the shorter twin of page 138 — where the shepherd's shadows die without moonlight, here the poet does. Ben's own pencil rendering is in the margin of the printed page ('oy cloud / come quicker / I die... without moonlight'), first word indistinct; it is recorded in raw photos/persian_poems.md but not copied into a layer here, since it is a jotting rather than a finished draft. Same date as page 138. 29 Farvardin = 18 April 1992. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

ای ابر...
زودتر بگذر...
من بی‌مهتاب... می‌میرم...
۱۳۷۱/۱/۲۹

===machine===

O cloud...
pass over sooner...
Without moonlight... I die...
1371/1/29

===lantern===

O cloud —
pass over sooner.
Without moonlight... I die...

1371/1/29

